 ('MON_HOC','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mamonhoc":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenviettat":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenmonhoc":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mota":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"danghoatdong":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)","UNIQUE (mamonhoc)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn môn; mã là khóa ứng viên, tên/viết tắt/mô tả là thuộc tính của môn, không tự suy từ mã.'),
 ('MO_HINH_LOP','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mamohinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenmohinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"sisotoida":{"type":"numeric","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"danghoatdong":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK (((sisotoida > (0)::numeric) AND (sisotoida = trunc(sisotoida))))","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)","UNIQUE (mamohinh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn mô hình và sĩ số tối đa; lớp JOIN giới hạn. Tên/mã là vai trò mô tả và định danh riêng.'),
 ('MUC_DANH_MUC','{"madanhmuc":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ma":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ten":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mota":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"danghoatdong":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"thutu":{"type":"integer","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK (((btrim(madinhdanh) <> ''''::text) AND (btrim(ma) <> ''''::text) AND (btrim(ten) <> ''''::text) AND (thutu > 0)))","FOREIGN KEY (madanhmuc) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"DANH_MUC_BO_SUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE CASCADE","PRIMARY KEY (madanhmuc, madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'["CREATE UNIQUE INDEX muc_danh_muc_ma_trong_nhom ON vuihoc.\"MUC_DANH_MUC\" USING btree (madanhmuc, upper(btrim(ma)))"]'::jsonb,'Mục thuộc nhóm; mã chỉ duy nhất trong nhóm. Không chép tên nhóm, không giả định mã mục là duy nhất toàn hệ thống.'),
 ('NGUOI_DUNG','{"manhomquyen":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"hoten":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tendangnhap":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"thudientu":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"sodienthoai":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"trangthai":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"maphien_bam":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"phienhethan":{"type":"timestamp with time zone","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"solansai":{"type":"integer","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tamkhoaden":{"type":"timestamp with time zone","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"matkhau":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK ((matkhau ~ ''^[0-9]{6,8}$''::text))","CHECK ((trangthai = ANY (ARRAY[''active''::text, ''locked''::text])))","FOREIGN KEY (manhomquyen) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NHOM_QUYEN\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)","UNIQUE (tendangnhap)"]'::jsonb,'["CREATE UNIQUE INDEX nguoi_dung_username_normalized ON vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\" USING btree (lower(btrim(tendangnhap)))"]'::jsonb,'Nguồn liên hệ/tài khoản; FK nhóm quyền, vai trò/môn/avatar được truy vấn. Phiên đăng nhập và giới hạn thử sai là dữ kiện vận hành của tài khoản.'),
 ('NHAN_XET_BUOI_HOC','{"mabuoi":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mahocsinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"noidung":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoicapnhat":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["FOREIGN KEY (mabuoi) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"BUOI_HOC\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (mahocsinh) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"HOC_SINH\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manguoicapnhat) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","PRIMARY KEY (mabuoi, mahocsinh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nội dung nhận xét của học sinh trong buổi và tác giả; không chứa tiêu chí/bộ đếm AI đã nghỉ.'),
 ('NHOM_QUYEN','{"congtruycap":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tennhomquyen":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"phanloai":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mota":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"macdinh":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK ((congtruycap = ANY (ARRAY[''ADMIN''::text, ''TEACHER''::text])))","CHECK ((phanloai = ANY (ARRAY[''HỆ THỐNG''::text, ''CHUYÊN MÔN''::text, ''VẬN HÀNH''::text, ''GIẢNG DẠY''::text])))","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn nhóm/quy tắc truy cập; số tài khoản và danh sách quyền truy vấn từ quan hệ, không lưu mảng quyền.'),
 ('NHOM_QUYEN_CHI_TIET','{"manhom":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"maquyen":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"thutu":{"type":"integer","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK ((thutu > 0))","FOREIGN KEY (manhom) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NHOM_QUYEN\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE CASCADE","FOREIGN KEY (maquyen) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"QUYEN\"(maquyen)","PRIMARY KEY (manhom, maquyen)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Quan hệ nhóm–quyền; chỉ hai FK và thứ tự. Tên quyền JOIN QUYEN, không chép nhãn.'),
 ('PHIEN_BAN_LICH_RANH','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"magiaovien":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoicapnhat":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"hieuluctu":{"type":"timestamp with time zone","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["FOREIGN KEY (magiaovien) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"GIAO_VIEN\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manguoicapnhat) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)","UNIQUE (magiaovien, hieuluctu)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Phiên bản lịch có hiệu lực của giáo viên; ngày hết hiệu lực lấy từ lần kế tiếp. Không lưu lại theo tuần.'),
 ('PHIEN_CHAT_AI','{"maphien":{"type":"uuid","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"thoigianbatdau":{"type":"timestamp with time zone","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoidung":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["FOREIGN KEY (manguoidung) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE CASCADE","PRIMARY KEY (maphien)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Đầu phiên thuộc tài khoản; không lưu thêm mã giáo viên được xác định từ tài khoản.'),
 ('QUYEN','{"maquyen":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenquyen":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["PRIMARY KEY (maquyen)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn quyền; mã định danh và nhãn hiển thị có thể bằng nhau lúc khởi tạo nhưng có ý nghĩa riêng.'),
 ('SU_CO_BUOI_HOC','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mabuoi":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manhomsuco":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"masuco":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"hesocongapdung":{"type":"numeric","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"muckhancap":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"noidung":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"trangthai":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoibao":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoixuly":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"baoluc":{"type":"date","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"xulyluc":{"type":"date","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"ghichuxuly":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"dotamdunglop":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK (((hesocongapdung >= ''-999.999''::numeric) AND (hesocongapdung <= 999.999)))","CHECK (((xulyluc IS NULL) OR (xulyluc >= baoluc)))","CHECK ((muckhancap = ANY (ARRAY[''EMERGENCY''::text, ''ADVANCED''::text])))","CHECK ((trangthai = ANY (ARRAY[''DANG_XU_LY''::text, ''DA_GIAI_QUYET''::text, ''HUY_CA''::text])))","FOREIGN KEY (mabuoi) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"BUOI_HOC\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manguoibao) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","FOREIGN KEY (manguoixuly) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","FOREIGN KEY (manhomsuco) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"DANH_MUC_SU_CO\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manhomsuco, masuco) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"LOAI_SU_CO\"(manhom, ma) DEFERRABLE INITIALLY DEFERRED","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'["CREATE UNIQUE INDEX mot_su_co_tam_dung_moi_buoi ON vuihoc.\"SU_CO_BUOI_HOC\" USING btree (mabuoi) WHERE dotamdunglop"]'::jsonb,'Một biên bản sự cố và việc xử lý/công đã áp dụng; mã loại JOIN tên. Đối chiếu riêng bản tự sinh từ tạm dừng, không coi đồng bộ là bằng chứng chuẩn hóa.'),
 ('TAI_LIEU_QUY_TRINH','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tieude":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"maloaitailieu":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tomtat":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"noidung":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tentepgoc":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"loaitepgoc":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"dangsudung":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"linkdrive":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoitailen":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK (((linkdrive = ''''::text) OR (linkdrive ~ ''^https://(drive|docs)\\.google\\.com/[^[:space:]]*$''::text)))","CHECK ((loaitepgoc = ANY (ARRAY[''PDF''::text, ''DOCX''::text])))","FOREIGN KEY (maloaitailieu) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"LOAI_TAI_LIEU\"(madinhdanh) ON UPDATE RESTRICT ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manguoitailen) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nội dung tệp/tài liệu; FK loại và tài khoản tải lên. Không chép tên người tải/loại.'),
 ('TRINH_DO','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"matrinhdo":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenviettat":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tentrinhdo":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"doituonghocsinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"muctieu":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"danghoatdong":{"type":"boolean","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)","UNIQUE (matrinhdo)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn trình độ; mã là khóa ứng viên, đối tượng và mục tiêu là thuộc tính của trình độ.'),
 ('TRUY_VET_XEP_LOP','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"bigint","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mahocsinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"malopcu":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"malopmoi":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"thoigian":{"type":"timestamp with time zone","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"manguoithuchien":{"type":"text","nullable":"YES","generated":"NEVER"},"nguon":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["CHECK (((malopcu IS NOT NULL) OR (malopmoi IS NOT NULL)))","CHECK ((malopcu IS DISTINCT FROM malopmoi))","CHECK ((nguon = ANY (ARRAY[''THAO_TAC''::text, ''LICH_SU''::text, ''HIEN_TRANG''::text])))","FOREIGN KEY (mahocsinh) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"HOC_SINH\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (malopcu) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"LOP_HOC\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (malopmoi) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"LOP_HOC\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE RESTRICT","FOREIGN KEY (manguoithuchien) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"NGUOI_DUNG\"(madinhdanh) ON DELETE SET NULL","PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Một sự kiện xếp/ra/chuyển lớp; hai FK lớp có vai trò cũ/mới. Môn JOIN lớp, không lưu bản sao.'),
 ('VAN_PHONG_NHAN_XET','{"madinhdanh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"tenvanphong":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"chidan":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaytao":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"ngaycapnhat":{"type":"date","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["PRIMARY KEY (madinhdanh)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Nguồn văn phong nhận xét; tên và chỉ dẫn độc lập với persona trợ lý. Nơi chọn văn phong chỉ giữ FK.'),
 ('XEP_LOP_DANG_KY','{"mahocsinh":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"mamonhoc":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"},"malop":{"type":"text","nullable":"NO","generated":"NEVER"}}'::jsonb,'["FOREIGN KEY (mahocsinh, mamonhoc) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"DANG_KY_MON_HOC\"(mahocsinh, mamonhoc) ON DELETE CASCADE","FOREIGN KEY (malop, mamonhoc) REFERENCES vuihoc.\"LOP_HOC\"(madinhdanh, mamonhoc) ON DELETE RESTRICT","PRIMARY KEY (mahocsinh, mamonhoc)","UNIQUE (mahocsinh, malop)"]'::jsonb,'[]'::jsonb,'Liên kết đúng đăng ký học sinh/môn với lớp đúng môn; mã môn là phần khóa đăng ký và FK chéo, không chép tên môn.')
), actual_columns AS (
 SELECT c.table_name,jsonb_object_agg(c.column_name,jsonb_build_object('type',c.data_type,'nullable',c.is_nullable,'generated',c.is_generated)) columns
 FROM information_schema.columns c JOIN information_schema.tables t USING(table_catalog,table_schema,table_name)
 WHERE c.table_schema='vuihoc' AND t.table_type='BASE TABLE' GROUP BY c.table_name
), actual_constraints AS (
 SELECT t.relname table_name,jsonb_agg(pg_get_constraintdef(k.oid) ORDER BY pg_get_constraintdef(k.oid)) definitions,
 bool_and(k.convalidated) validated FROM pg_constraint k JOIN pg_class t ON t.oid=k.conrelid JOIN pg_namespace n ON n.oid=t.relnamespace CROSS JOIN settings
 WHERE n.nspname='vuihoc' AND k.contype IN ('p','u','f','c','x') GROUP BY t.relname
), actual_indexes AS (
 SELECT t.relname table_name,jsonb_agg(pg_get_indexdef(i.indexrelid) ORDER BY pg_get_indexdef(i.indexrelid)) definitions
 FROM pg_index i JOIN pg_class t ON t.oid=i.indrelid JOIN pg_namespace n ON n.oid=t.relnamespace CROSS JOIN settings
 WHERE n.nspname='vuihoc' AND i.indisunique AND NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM pg_constraint c WHERE c.conindid=i.indexrelid) GROUP BY t.relname
), comparison AS (
 SELECT coalesce(r.table_name,a.table_name) table_name,r.business_scope,
 r.table_name IS NOT NULL reviewed,a.table_name IS NOT NULL present,
 coalesce(a.columns=r.columns,false) columns_match,
 coalesce(c.definitions @> r.required_constraints AND r.required_constraints @> c.definitions AND jsonb_array_length(c.definitions)=jsonb_array_length(r.required_constraints),false) constraints_match,
 coalesce(c.validated,false) constraints_validated,
 coalesce(i.definitions,'[]'::jsonb) @> coalesce(r.required_indexes,'[]'::jsonb) AND coalesce(r.required_indexes,'[]'::jsonb) @> coalesce(i.definitions,'[]'::jsonb)
  AND jsonb_array_length(coalesce(i.definitions,'[]'::jsonb))=jsonb_array_length(coalesce(r.required_indexes,'[]'::jsonb)) indexes_match,
 coalesce(a.columns,'{}'::jsonb) actual_columns,coalesce(r.columns,'{}'::jsonb) reviewed_columns,
 coalesce(c.definitions,'[]'::jsonb) actual_constraints,coalesce(r.required_constraints,'[]'::jsonb) reviewed_constraints,
 coalesce(i.definitions,'[]'::jsonb) actual_unique_indexes,coalesce(r.required_indexes,'[]'::jsonb) reviewed_unique_indexes
 FROM reviewed r FULL JOIN actual_columns a USING(table_name)
 LEFT JOIN actual_constraints c ON c.table_name=coalesce(r.table_name,a.table_name)
 LEFT JOIN actual_indexes i ON i.table_name=coalesce(r.table_name,a.table_name)
)
SELECT table_name,CASE WHEN NOT reviewed THEN 'CHUA_RA_BANG_NAY' WHEN NOT present THEN 'THIEU_BANG'
 WHEN columns_match AND constraints_match AND constraints_validated AND indexes_match THEN 'KHOP_CAU_TRUC_DA_RA' ELSE 'CAN_RA_LAI' END status,
 business_scope,columns_match,constraints_match,constraints_validated,indexes_match,
 actual_columns,reviewed_columns,actual_constraints,reviewed_constraints,actual_unique_indexes,reviewed_unique_indexes
FROM comparison ORDER BY table_name;
